station-event-meteor-swarm-announcement = Meteors have slipped into the periphery shield. Seek shelter away from external areas.
station-event-meteor-swarm-complete-announcement = The meteor swarm has passed.

station-event-space-dust-announcement = The district outskirts are passing through a debris cloud, expect minor damage to external fittings and fixtures.
station-event-meteor-urist-announcement = The district is colliding with an unidentified swarm of debris. Please stay calm and do not listen to them.
